<title>USA: Seafield Capital Corp Q3 profit vs loss. [CORRECTED 20:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Seafield Capital Corp Q3 profit vs loss. [CORRECTED 20:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	profit	  $0.11     loss	 $0.25</p>
<p> Net	profit	    696     loss	 1,591</p>
<p> Revs			33,318		   28,226</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,489		    6,444</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 earnings by LabOne Inc, which is 82 percent owned by Seafield, were $815,000 in 1996 versus $270,000 last year.</p>
<p>(Corrects figures from &quot;$12.4 million in 1996 versus $12.3 million last year&quot;).</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 earnings by Ressponse Oncology Inc, which is 55 percent owned by Seafield, were $674,000 in 1996 versus $605,000 last year.</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr     profit  $0.12	     loss $0.08</p>
<p> Net     profit   768		loss  515</p>
<p> Revs		 90,890		   94,418</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   6,481		    6,452</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
